OL,3,GNEWSAMeningitis survivor finally gets
OL,4,Aprosthetic hand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student says life is "getting almost
OL,7,Fas close as it can be to normal" after
OL,8,Freceiving his first prosthetic hand two
OL,9,Fyears after having parts of his limbs
OL,10,Famputated.
OL,12,FHamish Wilson was three weeks into his
OL,13,Fdegree at the University of Southampton
OL,14,Fwhen he became ill with meningitis in
OL,15,FOctober 2024, leading to parts of all
OL,16,Ffour of his limbs being amputated after
OL,17,Fhe developed sepsis.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
