OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMeningitis survivor finally gets
OL,4,Aprosthetic hand
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilson, from Crowborough in East
OL,7,FSussex, received prosthetic legs in
OL,8,FJanuary 2025 and said having hands was
OL,9,Fsomething he had wanted for a long
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,FThe 20-year-old told the BBC: "It's
OL,13,Freally cool. It's not the full finished
OL,14,Fproduct yet and I've only had it for
OL,15,Fabout 24 hours, but it's great."
